## DevelopOptions

**Namespace:** `Cyrena.Coding.Options`
**Assembly:** `Cyrena.Coding.Core`

### Purpose
Contains constant string keys used in `ChatConfiguration` dictionary for developer mode setup.

### Constants

```csharp
public sealed class DevelopOptions
{
    public const string AssistantModeId = "developer";
    public const string BuilderId = "dev.builder-id";
    public const string RootDirectory = "dev.root-dir";
}
```

### Usage

**Setting configuration:**
```csharp
model[DevelopOptions.BuilderId] = "cs-class-library";
model[DevelopOptions.RootDirectory] = @"C:\path\to\project";
```

**Reading configuration:**
```csharp
var builderId = config[DevelopOptions.BuilderId];
var rootDir = config[DevelopOptions.RootDirectory];
```

**Assistant mode registration:**
```csharp
builder.AddAssistantMode<DeveloperAssistantMode>();
```
Where `DeveloperAssistantMode.Id == DevelopOptions.AssistantModeId`
